<meta charset="utf-8"><title>Mars and its Moons: An Orbital Architecture Under Gravitational Tension | Astronoo</title><meta content="Phobos and Deimos: a scientific exploration of their unstable orbits, their formation and their future around Mars." name="description"><meta content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1.0" name="viewport"><link href="/favicon.ico" rel="shortcut icon" type="image/x-icon"><link href="/styles/astronoo.css" rel="stylesheet" type="text/css"><link href="https://astronoo.com/en/moons-of-mars.html" rel="canonical"><link href="https://astronoo.com/fr/lunes-de-mars.html" hreflang="fr" rel="alternate"><link href="https://astronoo.com/en/moons-of-mars.html" hreflang="en" rel="alternate"><link href="https://astronoo.com/es/lunas-de-marte.html" hreflang="es" rel="alternate"><link href="https://astronoo.com/pt/luas-de-marte.html" hreflang="pt" rel="alternate"><link href="https://astronoo.com/de/monde-des-mars.html" hreflang="de" rel="alternate"><link href="https://astronoo.com/ja/moons-of-mars.html" hreflang="ja" rel="alternate"><link href="https://astronoo.com/zh/moons-of-mars.html" hreflang="zh" rel="alternate"><link href="https://astronoo.com/llms.txt" rel="alternate" type="text/plain" title="Astronoo - Index for Language Models"><script defer="" src="/js/flag.js"></script>
